{"path":"iterator/make_reverse_iterator","title":"std::make_reverse_iterator","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>make_reverse_iterator","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/iterator/make_reverse_iterator","section":"iterator","kind":"page","summary":"make_reverse_iterator is a convenience function template that constructs a std::reverse_iterator for the given iterator i (which must be a LegacyBidirectionalIterator) with the type deduced from the type of the argument.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/iterator\">&lt;iterator&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx14\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Iter <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/reverse_iterator\"><span class=\"kw663\">std::<span class=\"me2\">reverse_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Iter<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> make_reverse_iterator<span class=\"br0\">(</span> Iter i <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(since C++14)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>make_reverse_iterator</code> is a convenience function template that constructs a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/reverse_iterator\">std::reverse_iterator</a></span> for the given iterator <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i</span></code> (which must be a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/BidirectionalIterator\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">LegacyBidirectionalIterator</em></a>) with the type deduced from the type of th